@* The landing's hero (F118, F128.1, FX160): the framework's SiteHero with the agent's mark, the design's words and its
   two buttons, configured (ADR 0125). *@
<SiteHero Centred="true">
    <Art><MarkStates /></Art>
    <Headline>Ask the website.</Headline>
    <Summary>We build websites that answer for your business. An agent on the page shows the room, takes the booking and sends it to you, while you're busy with the guests you already have.</Summary>
    <Actions>
        <LinkButton Href="/contact" Text="Ask for yours" />
        <LinkButton Href="/home/does" Text="See what it does" Kind="ButtonKind.Quiet" Section="does" />
    </Actions>
</SiteHero>
